<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RBA December commodity index up 0.5 percent.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RBA December commodity index up 0.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said on Thursday its December index of commodity prices rose by 0.5 percent in Special Drawing Rights (SDR) terms.</p>
<p>This followed a fall of 1.1 percent in November, it said.</p>
<p>Rises in the prices of oil and aluminium were partly offset by falls in the prices of beef and gold, the RBA said.</p>
<p>In Australian dollar terms, the index fell by 0.6 percent, following a fall of 0.8 percent in November.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
